      "file_path": "docs/session-rules.md",
      "heading": "到期边界",
      "source_hash": "bfa3dbaa5c7b1df408032cc94bb23745ddc5afaa0aa10b3eefb7afab6c4bccdb",
      "project_id": "login_demo",
      "generation": "20261102T031719-d6ea49c5",
      "text": "登录会话有效期规则\n到期边界\n- 项目约定：当前时刻恰好等于到期时刻时，会话必须判定为无效。\n- 也就是说，`now == expires_at` 属于已过期。\n- 实现上有效条件写作 `now < expires_at`，不要写成 `now <= expires_at`。"
    },
    {
      "node_id": "ad68ccd39b2e1f3943f7b85ba0d54e22ac22eefcd236a90ae99cf269721ff5da",
      "score": 0.6119408245230633,
      "file_path": "docs/session-rules.md",
      "heading": "不适用范围",
      "source_hash": "bfa3dbaa5c7b1df408032cc94bb23745ddc5afaa0aa10b3eefb7afab6c4bccdb",
      "project_id": "login_demo",
      "generation": "20261102T031719-d6ea49c5",
      "text": "登录会话有效期规则\n不适用范围\n- 本节规则只约束登录会话，不适用于支付会话、匿名浏览会话。"
    }
  ],
